  "description": "A strong market bounce, fresh BUY setups, and a 29.6% average move from our top-ranked Midweek Movers.",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Saturday! Hope you are enjoying your weekend. The S&amp;P 500 and Russell 2000 showed us a significant bounce this week, after consolidating down from all time highs in mid-August. These are great signs of a continuation into next week. </p><p>I re-emphasize, to <em><strong>IGNORE THE NEWS</strong></em>. Headlines with the bearish narratives such as the Iran War, Oil depletion, Inflation, Fed Tightening, Bond Yields, AI Bubble, Market Concentration, Labor Weakness, Tariffs…and the list goes on… have done nothing but keep investors scared and away from the markets.</p><h4>Meanwhile, the S&amp;P 500 has hit 27 all time highs in 2026.<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> </h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><span>If you missed any of these posts this week, worry not, all of them below are still relevant. </span><em><strong>Never</strong></em><span> feel like you have to catch every post at the exact moment. I invest and trade with you all in mind, knowing that you have busy lives. You never need to be “first” to a post. This is one of many reasons I do not day or short term trade.</span></p><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/36-stocks-ranked-only-2-meet-all\">Agriculture &amp; Silver Stocks Presenting BUYS NOW</a> (Midweek Movers)</h4><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-market-pulled-back-im-buying\">2 Stocks I Am Buying and Levels I am Watching For</a></h4><p>Fun fact about Midweek movers. We reviewed all the 1st Place Picks and 2nd Place picks over the last year, up to August (which are still running)…every single winning stock went up shortly after being selected, averaging 29.6%. Fast forward to today, 75% of them are still up. PLUG won back in May, and ran a whopping 55.36%. Clearly the Midweek movers stock selection process is working…and even I need to double down on them more!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"255\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:255,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:170646,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/214163204?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Fw-h!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc3183387-0410-4aad-b75d-6048363aa369_1610x282.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Midweek Movers Process Clearly Works. Note, we did not do this series in March and April due to unfavorable markets. There will be periods I pause…this is to keep accuracy high, and retain prior made profits. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Be sure to take some time off from the charts, its best to come in fresh on Monday’s…you make better decisions. </p><p>If you have questions, feel free to tag me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d18286d6-5152-4f20-85c8-cedb68ee0e71\">Main Chat</a> during market hours. </p><h4>Please Re-Stack 🔄 and Like ❤️ this post, it really helps combat the AI Slop surge! </h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/you-may-have-missed-the-best-setups?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/you-may-have-missed-the-best-setups?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/you-may-have-missed-the-best-setups?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/p-500-hit-27-record-110100517.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com</p></div></div>",
